<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 8px;"><h1 style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#102a43;margin:0 0 16px;">Primary Admin transfer request</h1>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Hi,</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Jordan Lee wants to make you Primary Admin of SGA Auth.</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Accept by October 23, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 24px;"><a href="https://auth.northeasternsga.com/admin/transfer" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;display:inline-block;background:#c8102e;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;">Review transfer</a></p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#52606d;margin:0 0 16px;">If the button doesn't work, copy this link:<br><a href="https://auth.northeasternsga.com/admin/transfer" style="color:#52606d;word-break:break-all;">https://auth.northeasternsga.com/admin/transfer</a></p>

</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#7b8794;padding:16px 32px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e4e7eb;">Sent by SGA Auth, the sign-in for Northeastern SGA tools. Replies to this address aren&#39;t read.</td></tr>
