<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>You now have admin access</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fa;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;">You now have admin access</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f5f7fa;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;">
<tr><td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;color:#c8102e;padding:24px 32px 0;">SGA Auth</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 8px;"><h1 style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#102a43;margin:0 0 16px;">You now have admin access</h1>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">Hi,</p><p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 16px;">This happened at October 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET. If this wasn&#39;t you, reset your password right away and contact SGA.</p>


</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#7b8794;padding:16px 32px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e4e7eb;">Sent by SGA Auth, the sign-in for Northeastern SGA tools. Replies to this address aren&#39;t read.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "subject": "You now have admin access in SGA Auth",
  "text": "SGA Auth

You now have admin access

Hi,

This happened at October 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM ET. If this wasn't you, reset your password right away and contact SGA.

--
Sent by SGA Auth, the sign-in for Northeastern SGA tools. Replies to this address aren't read.",
}
`;

